[{"text":"5 Complete the conversations with the compound","y":0.045008183424064763,"w":0.39911308288574215,"x":0.015521058889723207,"h":0.011865793780687417},{"x":0.037694017068389395,"w":0.18403547286987307,"y":0.059593023381013466,"text":"adjectives in Exercise 4.","h":0.011627906668205679},{"x":0.061967210642330989,"y":0.076578688377418991,"w":0.10222966194152833,"h":0.012540297500435504,"text":"A: What's up?"},{"text":"B: It's my sister. She's decided to start a band, but","x":0.062084268343004075,"h":0.013176550061339887,"y":0.091569767687107673,"w":0.3725055313110352},{"h":0.011865793780687306,"y":0.10597381330803446,"text":"she's terrible at the guitar. I'm trying to persuade","w":0.3658536529541016,"x":0.079822622857760706},{"h":0.010293361598262996,"y":0.12063953514081061,"text":"her not to - it'd be a disaster. But once Jane decides","x":0.079822635144976561,"w":0.38580928802490239},{"w":0.32594234466552735,"text":"to do something it's impossible to stop her.","x":0.079822617874183918,"y":0.13502454955541188,"h":0.013231264588875802},{"w":0.33702880859375001,"x":0.062084268696473044,"text":"A: You know your sister, she's so strong-willec","h":0.011627906668205679,"y":0.14970930239264135},{"w":0.25942350387573243,"text":"I doubt you'll manage to stop her!","h":0.011865793780687306,"y":0.1640752863794519,"x":0.077605317990071754},{"x":0.03769401311492962,"w":0.011086474657058719,"h":0.010174418042022237,"y":0.18459302336755479,"text":"1"},{"text":"A: What do you think about social media?","x":0.062084261708363224,"y":0.18453355186354015,"w":0.31263856887817376,"h":0.013140866877404456},{"h":0.013228885085610043,"text":"B: Well, it's got advantages and disadvantages.","x":0.062084258060592215,"y":0.19912790694946236,"w":0.35254989624023442},{"h":0.01315989822100494,"w":0.38137470245361327,"x":0.079822622165654736,"text":"I mean, it's a great way of keeping in touch and it's","y":0.21358428801630591},{"text":"fun, but it's easy to spend too long online.","x":0.079822629833657149,"y":0.22819767442160388,"h":0.013209854522430287,"w":0.31707315444946294},{"text":"A: You're very","w":0.10213135719299316,"h":0.012148326430500234,"y":0.24247234834931142,"x":0.062016362334045498},{"x":0.31925833135436021,"text":", aren't you?","h":0.013287839249581213,"w":0.097625246047973624,"y":0.24262933602365155},{"text":"2 A: I wish I could be as","w":0.1862527656555176,"x":0.037694017615700161,"h":0.01162790666820579,"y":0.26308139530930796},{"w":0.050997781753540083,"x":0.38137472395138955,"h":0.010229132569558042,"text":"as you","y":0.26595744693545953},{"h":0.011646937621595743,"text":"You never seem to be stressed out about anything,","w":0.38580928802490239,"x":0.079822632572914609,"y":0.27905073661366986},{"text":"not even exams.","x":0.079822615971064437,"w":0.12195121765136718,"h":0.0087685077748400619,"y":0.29360465103559119},{"text":"B: Well, doing yoga and getting enough sleep helps","x":0.062084257536039085,"h":0.01328122010988031,"w":0.39246120452880856,"y":0.30668604646617748},{"h":0.010174418042022126,"text":"me stay calm.","x":0.079822620287127305,"y":0.32267441871639202,"w":0.10643014907836915},{"h":0.010174418042022126,"x":0.037694013908765998,"w":0.01330376863479614,"y":0.34302325602259354,"text":"3"},{"y":0.34288052362269172,"text":"A: You've eaten all the biscuits again and left","w":0.34589797973632808,"x":0.050997789289264045,"h":0.011865793780687417},{"x":0.079637671715978117,"y":0.35414379383857719,"text":"the kitchen in a real mess. How can you be","w":0.32412940979003901,"h":0.01564689704907507},{"h":0.0087209301962594132,"x":0.079822616945928043,"text":"SO","w":0.019955652952194217,"y":0.37354651179140519},{"x":0.25720620532363248,"y":0.37063953507446235,"h":0.013157518717739292,"text":"? I wish you'd think about","w":0.19512195587158204},{"x":0.079822623887705252,"text":"the rest of us sometimes!","w":0.19068735122680666,"h":0.010324286946298278,"y":0.38502454989084656},{"h":0.01688083455137257,"text":"B: Sorry! I'll clear it up now.","x":0.061603295858170953,"y":0.39800896230428995,"w":0.20485561370849611},{"text":"4 A: Matt's great, isn't he? I was really upset after l'd","y":0.42005813947732096,"h":0.013247916429210638,"w":0.39911308288574221,"x":0.037694016206796271},{"y":0.43453355165641805,"w":0.35920177459716796,"h":0.013140866877404456,"text":"had an argument and he took me out for coffee","x":0.079822619619376062},{"x":0.079822629672838832,"w":0.34146339416503912,"text":"and just listened to me. He's one of the most","y":0.44912790693721494,"h":0.011627906668205679},{"h":0.01162790666820579,"y":0.46511627915136222,"x":0.23503326122165513,"w":0.11086474418640141,"text":"people I know."},{"text":"B: Definitely! He'll always help you if he can, and he's","y":0.47819767437315419,"h":0.013209854522430398,"x":0.062084260774423757,"w":0.39911308288574221},{"text":"really generous, too.","w":0.15742793083190917,"x":0.079822622573697932,"h":0.011627906668205679,"y":0.49418604666589716},{"y":0.51453488394773894,"x":0.03769402546480087,"w":0.41463413238525387,"text":"5 A: I wish I was more confident. I never know what to","h":0.010174418042022126},{"h":0.013100426247779295,"text":"say to people and I feel like they're going to think","y":0.52905073673371761,"w":0.37694011688232426,"x":0.079822620198897132},{"h":0.011632664504105938,"text":"I'm boring","y":0.54360465137519942,"x":0.079822615525173002,"w":0.079822616577148453},{"h":0.010229132569558042,"text":"B: Don't be so","x":0.062084257919355464,"y":0.55810147281353906,"w":0.10864745140075685},{"text":"_, you' ve got","x":0.31929046666738642,"y":0.55959302316066728,"w":0.10199556350708011,"h":0.010374243637934044},{"x":0.079822620983934028,"text":"a great personality!","w":0.14634145736694334,"h":0.013107562416313945,"y":0.57119476291983418},{"y":0.59288052340480335,"h":0.013224127639920313,"w":0.39467849731445315,"x":0.037694015699757805,"text":"6 A: My brother lost his temper again! I don't know"},{"h":0.013145624323094074,"w":0.37250553131103514,"y":0.60755813972562522,"text":"what's up with him - he seems to get angry really","x":0.079822626971976729},{"text":"easily at the moment.","x":0.082039912735490148,"y":0.62354651183654697,"w":0.15964523315429685,"h":0.010250542245793137},{"x":0.062084268225740404,"y":0.63662790705833905,"h":0.011627906668205679,"text":"B: Really? Perhaps there's a reason he's so","w":0.31485586166381835},{"w":0.15077605247497561,"h":0.013138488154559647,"x":0.23281596461617077,"y":0.64970930251632275,"text":". Have you asked if"},{"w":0.13968957901000975,"y":0.66569767434408444,"x":0.079822617656857636,"text":"anything's wrong?","h":0.013107563196734784},{"h":0.013174171338494967,"y":0.6889534883266426,"x":0.015521081321405958,"w":0.3436806869506836,"text":"WORD STORE 2C | Describing personality"},{"h":0.010229132569558153,"x":0.015521067269450803,"w":0.25942350387573243,"text":"6 Find and correct the mistakes.","y":0.71072013103269882},{"w":0.36141906738281249,"h":0.013209854522430398,"text":"If you have a love on learning, you'll really enjoy","y":0.72819767450033446,"x":0.062084253365134859},{"y":0.74418604666576227,"text":"university. of","w":0.099778270721435552,"x":0.062084258125978453,"h":0.0103147716647084},{"h":0.013190823178829802,"text":"1 The best way to make people feel on ease is to smile,","w":0.43237247467041018,"x":0.037694035946391119,"y":0.75726744191191386},{"x":0.062084257559546926,"h":0.011865793780687417,"text":"use their name and listen to them.","y":0.77168576109868059,"w":0.25942350387573243},{"w":0.42572059631347658,"y":0.78633720938392049,"x":0.037694030889824787,"text":"2 We need some new ideas. Can you think out the box","h":0.011627906668205679},{"x":0.062084258918945638,"y":0.80073649747794817,"w":0.2283813667297363,"h":0.011865793780687417,"text":"and come up with something?"},{"w":0.41019954681396481,"x":0.037694013039802632,"text":"3 Alex has a strong personality, she's a bit larger than","y":0.81540697693479247,"h":0.011627906668205679},{"h":0.010329045172408735,"w":0.14190687179565431,"text":"herself sometimes!","y":0.82978723406681654,"x":0.062084256932919357},{"y":0.84288052405804403,"x":0.037694029115988847,"h":0.013224126859499474,"w":0.42572059631347658,"text":"4 You don't have to be the soul and life of the party for"},{"h":0.013145625103515024,"y":0.85755813934408442,"text":"people to like you, just be yourself.","w":0.26385808944702149,"x":0.062084263147886037},{"y":0.87354651183062582,"w":0.37028823852539061,"h":0.011627906668205679,"text":"5 The best way to accept a compliment without","x":0.037694012038117924},{"y":0.8866279069131251,"h":0.013126593759914429,"text":"seeming too full with yourself is to just say 'Thank","x":0.062084268910640075,"w":0.37472282409667973},{"text":"you' and smile.","h":0.013258525080454553,"w":0.12421187400817871,"y":0.90107422590749287,"x":0.062062579477556439},{"y":0.05232558148732569,"w":0.26829267501831056,"h":0.01162790666820579,"text":"SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT","x":0.50776053802141163},{"x":0.4943494593160539,"h":0.011873951520155024,"w":0.29069972991943371,"y":0.075393955577880534,"text":"7 Choose the correct answers A-C."},{"text":"Personality survey","y":0.1216036964187921,"w":0.28398324966430666,"h":0.03223046772608773,"x":0.52655043793936218},{"h":0.011865793780687306,"text":"Please post your answers to the question","x":0.52993349264325784,"w":0.33702880859375006,"y":0.15834697228196382},{"x":0.52993348378826854,"w":0.36141906738281249,"text":"below. Answers will be anonymous. Thanks!","y":0.17296511652431701,"h":0.013205096296319829},{"x":0.52993349052803174,"h":0.014534883140151833,"y":0.19622093076519542,"w":0.31485586166381829,"text":"How would you describe yourself to"},{"w":0.10212075233459472,"y":0.21196984305947142,"x":0.52765359378674181,"text":"a stranger?","h":0.012106825208898053},{"w":0.35476718902587889,"x":0.52771617932298087,"h":0.013233643311720611,"text":"1 The most important thing to know about","y":0.23240589159928216},{"h":0.013136109431714837,"text":"me is that I'm traditional and very family-","x":0.52993349440453774,"y":0.24709302344655537,"w":0.33924610137939448},{"x":0.52993349303723503,"text":"oriented. I'm sociable and I'","y":0.26017441841385192,"w":0.23725053787231443,"h":0.013148003826359833},{"text":"most at ease","h":0.0087209301962595243,"y":0.26308139546388576,"x":0.78048780446297938,"w":0.11308203697204589},{"x":0.52771619762354671,"h":0.01324077948025526,"text":"in familiar situations. I think I'm ?","y":0.27454991800342199,"w":0.27716184616088868},{"x":0.81818182021040708,"h":0.013117078088114242,"text":"_, often","w":0.062084255218505913,"y":0.27616279065222393},{"y":0.29050736495176332,"text":"thinking of others before myself. I'd do","w":0.32150775909423834,"h":0.011865793780687417,"x":0.52771619018680538},{"w":0.36141906738281249,"y":0.30360065435604233,"h":0.013259810823855744,"text":"anything for the people I love. I'm definitely","x":0.52771618241169804},{"text":"3","x":0.52771618685776811,"w":0.013303768634796209,"h":0.0087209301962594132,"y":0.31831395340962221},{"text":"_and I don't do things without thinking","y":0.31688344834686699,"w":0.31756479263305659,"x":0.55190851008403419,"h":0.017548687524374107},{"text":"them through.","y":0.33428805208275025,"x":0.52549889597736366,"w":0.12638580322265613,"h":0.013095668802089677},{"text":"2 Everyone describes me as practical! I think","x":0.52993348806878171,"y":0.35465116273313479,"w":0.36807094573974608,"h":0.013188444455984993},{"h":0.011865793780687417,"y":0.36906710303698187,"w":0.36141906738281249,"x":0.52771619144717463,"text":"it's important to pay attention to the details"},{"x":0.52975462497007098,"text":"of everything and be 4_","y":0.3821498783698396,"h":0.01520151865657926,"w":0.18667928695678715},{"w":0.16186252593994133,"x":0.71840355007511425,"y":0.38372093047780542,"text":"_. What's the point","h":0.013169413112384398},{"text":"of doing something if you don't do it well?","y":0.39680232568129381,"h":0.013181307507029505,"x":0.52993348900802861,"w":0.34368068695068354},{"w":0.08203990936279304,"x":0.52771618859280889,"text":"I have a 5","h":0.011865793780687417,"y":0.41121112919626013},{"w":0.26209062576293951,"text":"of learning, but I wouldn't say","x":0.6117708681731534,"y":0.41065272569546518,"h":0.015302110225596466},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"text":"Iwas6","x":0.52771618666050946,"y":0.42587209303217621,"w":0.059866962432861381},{"w":0.28824832916259768,"y":0.42587209297780537,"text":"_, I'd rather be repairing my car or","x":0.59423504199667587,"h":0.01316227694384986},{"x":0.52974140735770037,"text":"building something than writing an essay or","y":0.44021032896546641,"h":0.016169249913891459,"w":0.36173728942871097},{"text":"doing research.","x":0.52993348317944511,"y":0.45621931253873016,"h":0.011865793780687417,"w":0.13082039833068848},{"text":"3 I'm a people person. Everyone says I'm","w":0.33924610137939448,"y":0.47667757763247298,"h":0.011865793780687417,"x":0.52993349457083472},{"text":"friendly,'_and have good relationships","w":0.33702880859374995,"y":0.48977086740045017,"h":0.014729950900163602,"x":0.52993349001206813},{"y":0.50572831435107901,"h":0.011865793780687417,"w":0.34146339416503901,"text":"with others, so it must be true! I wouldn't","x":0.52993348902243242},{"x":0.52993347711509597,"y":0.51882160424871493,"w":0.31707317352294928,"h":0.013155139994894482,"text":"say I was the 'life and _ of the party,'"},{"x":0.52993348868223333,"h":0.011865793780687417,"text":"though, because I don't always like being the","y":0.53477905055854169,"w":0.36807094573974608},{"h":0.013565599625707581,"x":0.52984276315303891,"text":"centre of attention. I'd rather be chatting to","y":0.54761919809659831,"w":0.3593853759765625},{"w":0.35920177459716796,"text":"someone quietly and getting to know them.","y":0.56249999986370647,"h":0.013195581404940482,"x":0.52993348038434296},{"y":0.57692307705608192,"text":"Strangers are just friend